# Raw data is never committed.  IEEE-CIS is distributed under Kaggle competition rules
# rather than an open licence, and the ULB database carries ODbL share-alike terms on the
# database itself.  Neither is reconstructible from this repository; both are fetched from
# their source under the terms recorded in docs/PROVENANCE.md section 1.
# Anchored to the repository root.  An unanchored `data/` matches at ANY depth and silently
# excluded src/hsbcfraud/data/ -- the IEEE-CIS loader, the four-block split, TestFoldGuard and
# the label audit were absent from three pushed commits, so a clone could not run anything.
# git add does not warn when it skips an ignored path.
/datasets/
/data/

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Intermediate run artefacts.  results/tables/*.csv and results/figures/* ARE committed:
# they are the source of every number in the documents and are hashed in the manifest.
results/runs/
*.parquet
*.joblib
*.ubj

# latexmk output.  The built PDFs are committed; their scaffolding is not.
submission/*.aux
submission/*.log
submission/*.out
submission/*.fls
submission/*.fdb_latexmk
submission/*.synctex.gz
submission/portal/
